Cell["Graviton Basis Toolkit Reference", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"62b29023-b9cf-df49-8d14-f7bbecaff5da"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook is the notebook and PDF rendering of \
graviton_basis_toolkit_reference.md. It explains both the algorithms and how \
they are realized in graviton_basis_toolkit.wl.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8c056a51-a557-554a-aedb-ea331bdeb2ac"],

