Raw scalar-basis generation from ordered derivative partitions\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f720e60d-7418-d94e-820f-dc97d5a0b0e2"],

Cell["IBP relations via VarD and SolveConstants", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c5360b29-6c05-ca43-b7f1-fefdaa80be8a"],

Cell["Field-redefinition image via the Fierz-Pauli variation", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"4f519317-0eb3-af46-9fb1-6ebc6e8e4273"],

