Cell["\<\
ReduceSectorLagrangian takes an expression and an explicit sector label, \
projects the expression into the IBP basis, subtracts the field-redefinition \
image component, and returns the remaining physical representative together \
with all intermediate coordinates.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a124de6b-c4ba-2e41-8fd5-0f2723b785c4"],

Cell["\<\
ReduceLagrangian canonicalizes and expands the input, splits it term by term \
into sectors, applies ReduceSectorLagrangian to each sector, and then sums \
the reduced representatives.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f30b894b-1ff8-c943-9bb6-86ca8f5ca00e"],

