Cell["Implementation Notes", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0666c356-381f-3441-a3ab-3b837c0211f8"],

Cell["\<\
Odd-derivative scalar sectors are empty in this setup and are skipped early.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"25b670a3-590d-f44a-af29-251540b79b9c"],

Cell["\<\
The cache is per intermediate object, not only per final sector summary.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7f1f0339-34ab-a044-8434-8ae1a347404b"],

Cell["\<\
ProjectModuloIBP sets any remaining unsolved ansatz coefficients to zero so \
returned coordinates are concrete.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"153242c7-6964-ee45-854d-0813a3e6f2ef"],

Cell["\<\
The current automatic splitter assumes the input uses the same h, eta, and PD \
conventions as the toolkit itself.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"5930b7de-c6e7-c644-8bef-59e73e2e190f"]
},
